## What was NOT run (and why)

- No `systemctl start|stop|restart|enable|disable` anywhere.
- No write to any board file, ledger, `gates.json`, budget, flag, or HALT.
- No `rm`, `mv`, `cp`, `chmod`, `chattr`.
- `ops_agent.py` was **not** imported/executed (side-effect risk); `budget_allows()` was
  re-implemented from source and run against the live receipts file instead.
- No vault census (belongs to the parallel UNIFIED-RECON lane).
- Secret material: never read into output. Only paths, sizes, counts, states, hashes.
